FIND
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  find . -name "file"       Find by name
  find . -type f            Find files
  find . -type d            Find directories
  find . -type f -name "*.qml"
                              Find QML files
  find . -type f -size +1G  Find files > 1 GB


GREP
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  grep "text" file          Search file
  grep -r "text" .          Search recursively
  grep -Ri "text" .         Recursive + case insensitive
  grep -n "text" file       Show line numbers


RIPGREP
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  rg "text"                 Search recursively
  rg -i "text"              Case insensitive
  rg "text" -g "*.qml"      Search only QML files


FILE INFORMATION
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  file <file>               Identify file type
  stat <file>               Detailed file information
